 "remarks": "Elevated 9th-floor living meets exceptional space and sweeping views in this impressive 1BR/1BA residence at Hayes House. Filled with natural light, this beautifully maintained home showcases classic parquet hardwood floors and an expansive living room that flows seamlessly into a dedicated dining area, creating a grand, open setting for everyday living and entertaining. Oversized windows frame impressive views, while the private covered balcony offers the perfect outdoor retreat. The well-appointed galley kitchen features crisp white cabinetry, generous counter space, stainless-steel appliances, and excellent storage. The oversized bedroom easily accommodates a king-size bedroom set with additional room for a sitting area or home office. Abundant storage throughout includes a large walk-in closet and multiple additional closets. Hayes House offers an exceptional amenity package including a fitness center, landscaped courtyard with grills, community room, private storage, bike storage, 24-hour security, concierge, on-site superintendent, community laundry, reserved garage parking, and guest parking. HOA includes heat, hot water, and central air. Ideally located moments from Metro-North, I-95, restaurants, shopping, parks, beaches, and vibrant Downtown Stamford.",
